  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "QZXing 是 ZXing C++ 条码识别库针对 Qt/QML 生态的封装库，提供 QImage 输入的条码解码与 QR 码编码能力，并可选集成 QML 类型注册和 Qt Multimedia 摄像头实时滤镜。它面向 Qt 应用开发者，用于在桌面/移动设备上快速集成一维码、二维码的扫描与生成功能。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "条码解码",
        "description": "支持 UPC-A/E、EAN-8/13、Code 39/93/128、Codabar、ITF、QR Code、Data Matrix、Aztec、PDF417 等多种条码/二维码解码格式。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/QZXing.h:74-94",
          "src/QZXing.cpp:56-72"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "QR 码编码",
        "description": "将字符串编码为 QR 码图像，支持自定义尺寸与纠错等级。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/QZXing.h:207-219",
          "src/QZXing.cpp:666-717"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Qt/QML 集成",
        "description": "向 Qt/C++ 提供 QZXing 对象与 decodeImage API，并可在 QML 中注册 QZXing 类型及 ImageProvider。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/QZXing.h:121-135",
          "src/QZXing.cpp:100-121"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "摄像头实时滤镜（可选）",
        "description": "通过 QZXingFilter / QZXingFilterVideoSink 将 Qt Multimedia 视频帧实时转换为灰度图并解码。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/QZXingFilter.cpp:88-147",
          "src/QZXingFilterVideoSink.cpp",
          "src/CMakeLists.txt:27-34"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "image processing / barcode",
    "target_users": "Qt/QML 应用开发者"
  },
